ologic manifestations in patients with inflammatory bowel disease: a prospective single-center study</article-title><source><italic>Inflammatory Bowel Diseases</italic></source><year>2009</year><volume>15</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>29</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18626979</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>